('DSR','2023','26.78.1','26.0','New Technologies','Providing & Applying weather proof sealant on outer joints of approved make confirming to IS & directed by Engineer-in-charge. — Sealant 25 mm x10 mm at joints','metre',178.95,true),
('DSR','2023','26.79.1','26.0','New Technologies','Providing & Laying of levelling sim pads required sizes (5x5 cm to 10x10 cm) of PVC / Rubber to adjust level of bearing surface of supporting members as per the direction of Engineer in charge. — 2 mm thick','each',28.90,true),
